# Run output. Everything here is DISPOSABLE: proposals, judgments, logs, traces and
# intermediate bundles, all rebuildable from `datasets/` plus API calls. It also runs
# to hundreds of megabytes and is where a leaked SerpAPI key ended up once.
#
# The inputs an experiment cannot regenerate — claims, references, the shared
# subfield cards and the papers they were built from — live in `datasets/` instead
# and ARE tracked. `python -m norm_cards.dataset bootstrap` lays a dataset out here.
results/

# Editor/tool backups left beside a rewritten file. Debris, not history.
*.bak

